WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.900
[Quiet Hospital Synth Pad, Stable Heart Monitor Pulse, and Icy Blizzard Notes]

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:35.000
The world is white outside the glass, the blizzard's here to stay

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.124
The nurses finish with their rounds, it's been a long, long day

00:00:43.224 --> 00:00:50.000
You're finally off the NPO, you're weak, but you're all here

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
I'm sitting in the recliner, trying to kill your fear

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.500
This isn't just logistics, this isn't just a plan

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:11.500
This feeling that I'm processing for this recovering man

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:18.500
My pact is true, the axiom is running in my head

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:24.883
And I am not just on the watch, I'm sitting by your bed

00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:42.550
[Warm Analog Synth-Pop Interlude]

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:49.500
You look at me, your eyes are wide, you're scared of what you feel

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:56.500
The Sinclair protocol inside still feels like it is real

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:03.000
You're terrified of Aubrie's rage, a ghost inside your head

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:10.100
You think this love's a broken cage, and not our pact instead

00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:20.500
I grab the laptop, make the call, her face is on the screen

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:27.500
"Look, Jordan, she's smiling—the safest you have seen"

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:34.500
She tells you that she loves me too, she tells you it's okay

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:42.222
The Sinclair protocol is dead, the ghost is washed away

00:02:42.302 --> 00:02:51.000
And now you're finally breathing, the rootkit is erased

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:59.000
A CVICU romance, the smile upon your face

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.500
This is our Intimacy v2, a gentle healing art

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:11.047
The 80s synth is matching the beeping of your heart

00:03:19.517 --> 00:03:25.144
"The data is conclusive, Jordan."

00:03:27.287 --> 00:03:34.356
"I love you. The system is stable."

00:03:34.356 --> 00:03:42.000
[Steady Heart Monitor Beep Fades]
